    "detailed_description": "<strong>Weapon Shop Decillionaire</strong> invites you to embark on an epic journey where the realm of fantasy meets the allure of wealth. In this captivating idle game, you'll transform your dreams into reality as you immerse yourself in the world of equipment and trade.<br><br><strong>Build and Sell Equipment</strong>: Forge a fortune by creating and selling powerful equipment. As your coffers fill with profits, you'll have the opportunity to enhance your creations, forging a cycle of endless wealth.<br><br><strong>Strategic Equipment Placement</strong>: Hone your strategic skills as you master the art of efficiently packing as much equipment as possible into your shop's grid. Maximizing your earnings and achieving decillionaire status hinges on the meticulous arrangement of equipment within your store.<br><br><strong>The Path to Decillionaire</strong>: With incremental gameplay at its core, <strong>Weapon Shop Decillionaire</strong> offers an addictive and thrilling experience. One piece at a time, you'll ascend the ranks of wealth and influence.<br><br>Enter a world where fantasy and prosperity intertwine. Are you ready to become a decillionaire, shaping your destiny one piece at a time? Take your place in the annals of entrepreneurial legends with <strong>Weapon Shop Decillionaire</strong>.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Weapon Shop Decillionaire</strong> invites you to embark on an epic journey where the realm of fantasy meets the allure of wealth. In this captivating idle game, you'll transform your dreams into reality as you immerse yourself in the world of equipment and trade.<br><br><strong>Build and Sell Equipment</strong>: Forge a fortune by creating and selling powerful equipment. As your coffers fill with profits, you'll have the opportunity to enhance your creations, forging a cycle of endless wealth.<br><br><strong>Strategic Equipment Placement</strong>: Hone your strategic skills as you master the art of efficiently packing as much equipment as possible into your shop's grid. Maximizing your earnings and achieving decillionaire status hinges on the meticulous arrangement of equipment within your store.<br><br><strong>The Path to Decillionaire</strong>: With incremental gameplay at its core, <strong>Weapon Shop Decillionaire</strong> offers an addictive and thrilling experience. One piece at a time, you'll ascend the ranks of wealth and influence.<br><br>Enter a world where fantasy and prosperity intertwine. Are you ready to become a decillionaire, shaping your destiny one piece at a time? Take your place in the annals of entrepreneurial legends with <strong>Weapon Shop Decillionaire</strong>.",
    "short_description": "Weapon Shop Decillionaire is an idle game where weapons turn your dreams of wealth into reality. Build and sell equipment, use the profit to enhance it, while mastering strategic weapon placement on your shop's grid. It's time to become a decillionaire, one sword at a time!",
